Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 12:41:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD vim visual selection so terminal panes can copy
 focused text

Terminal command mode supports character, line, and block selections in the focused pane. Copying a selection uses the rendered terminal cells, so both the real terminal adapter and UI harness exercise the same selection model.

The terminal adapter also applies controller events produced by the final idle poll before returning from wait_for_idle, so worker output rendered after an idle wait includes final directive follow-up lines.
